  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Burkina Faso 2001-2003</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Burkina Faso 2001-2003</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denna forskning samarbete syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra f&#xf6;rvaltning av naturresurser i Burkina Faso. Det tar ocks&#xe5; upp &#xf6;kad mj&#xf6;lkproduktion genom f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar i ko utfodring. Slutligen tar forskningen upp skogsutnyttjandet sett ur ett kulturellt antropologiskt perspektiv.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">This research cooperation seeks to improve natural resources management in Burkina Faso. It also addresses increased milk production through improvements in catlle feeds. Finally, the research looks at indigenous ways of forest utilization seen from a cultural anthropological perspective.</narrative>
  </description>
